  "description_text": "Welcome to 69-15 Utopia Parkway, Fresh Meadows, NY 11365! Discover the perfect combination of comfort, convenience, and opportunity in one of Queens' most desirable neighborhoods! This charming residence offers 3 spacious bedrooms, 2 full bathrooms, and a fully finished basement with a separate side entrance, providing additional flexible living space to suit your needs. Step outside and enjoy a generously sized side yard and backyard, offering plenty of room for entertaining, summer barbecues, gardening, or simply relaxing in your own private outdoor retreat. Parking is a breeze with a private three-car driveway and an attached one-car garage-a valuable convenience in NYC! Additional highlights include a roof and boiler approximately 7 years old, offering added peace of mind. With a building footprint of approximately 22' x 25.5', this home presents an exciting opportunity to move in, personalize, and make it your own. Ideally situated near shopping, dining, parks, schools, and transportation, this property offers the convenience of city living with the charm of a residential neighborhood.",
